  "No starting section was posted; the strategy says the starting location and interrupt depend on the opponent, and every matchup starts Obi-Wan's Hut, so starting is Tatooine: Obi-Wan's Hut and Heading For The Medical Frigate (the deck's only starting interrupt). Insurrection, Staging Areas and Your Insight Serves You Well are started in two matchups but not named as a single starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "Posted 'Mant. Savrip or Bacta Tank' (one line, two cards) is kept as written.",
