  "Combo interrupts: 'Tunnel V / Control' = Control & Tunnel Vision, 'Trans T / OOC' = Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated, 'Alter /FF' = Alter & Friendly Fire, 'Sense /RIF' = Sense & Recoil In Fear, 'Sorry ATM / BP' = Sorry About The Mess & Blaster Proficiency, 'Na Shadda / OOS' = Nar Shaddaa Wind Chimes & Out Of Somewhere.",
